WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.771 --> 00:00:02.956
Narrator: Rival scarves at half-time.

2
00:00:03.213 --> 00:00:06.298
Narrator: Faisal and Noura work as a pair.

3
00:00:06.683 --> 00:00:10.668
Narrator: Faisal talks, calm and friendly, from a safe distance.

4
00:00:11.053 --> 00:00:15.038
Faisal: Brothers, enjoy the day - plenty of room this way.

5
00:00:15.295 --> 00:00:17.865
Narrator: Noura covers and radios the facts.

6
00:00:18.251 --> 00:00:25.705
Noura: Sierra 2 ... Disturbance, north concourse by Kiosk 3, two groups, about 12 fans, shouting, no contact yet ...

7
00:00:25.962 --> 00:00:31.618
Narrator: When Faisal sees danger signs - clenched fists, quick glances - he steps further back.

8
00:00:32.003 --> 00:00:34.188
Narrator: Security arrive and take over.

9
00:00:34.445 --> 00:00:35.730
Narrator: Nobody gets hurt.
